    "重置安卓数据？": "Reset Android data?",
    "这会把安卓系统还原成「刚装好系统」的干净状态：": "This will restore Android to a clean, freshly installed state:",
    "• 删除全部已安装的第三方 app（含红果、游戏等）及其数据、登录态\\n": "• Remove all installed third-party apps (including games) and their data and sign-in sessions\\n",
    "• 删除当前 AVD 的快速启动快照\\n": "• Delete the current AVD quick-start snapshot\\n",
    "• 系统镜像本身不受影响，重新打开应用会再次冷启动建数据\\n\\n": "• The system image is not affected. Opening an app again will perform a fresh boot and recreate its data\\n\\n",
