    "已安装的 app 和它们的数据将被永久删除，确定要重置吗？": "Installed apps and their data will be permanently deleted. Are you sure you want to reset?",
    "可放心的是：系统镜像、其它 AVD、本机的 APK 缓存和图标都不会动。": "The system image, other AVDs, local APK cache, and icons will not be changed.",
    "确定重置": "Reset now",
    "，已安装应用记录已清空。": "; installed-app records have been cleared.",
    "修复虚拟机网络？": "Repair virtual machine network?",
    "应用里需要联网的页面一直黑屏/转圈，通常是安卓虚拟机没有网络。": "If online pages in apps remain black or keep loading, the Android virtual machine probably has no network connection.",
    "修复会按「代价从小到大」依次尝试：\\n\\n": "The repair tries these steps in order, from least to most disruptive:\\n\\n",
    "1. 冷启动虚拟机（不加载快照）后等待联网 —— 不影响任何数据\\n": "1. Cold-boot the virtual machine without loading a snapshot, then wait for networking — no data is affected\\n",
    "2. 仍不行才重置安卓数据 —— 应用清单保留、点开会自动重装，\\n": "2. Only if that fails, reset Android data — the app list is preserved and apps are reinstalled when opened,\\n",
    "   但应用内的登录态、追剧记录等会丢失\\n\\n": "   but in-app sign-in sessions, watch history, and similar data will be lost\\n\\n",
    "只影响当前 AVD，系统镜像和本机 APK 缓存都不动。整个过程约 1–5 分钟。是否继续？": "Only the current AVD is affected; the system image and local APK cache remain untouched. This takes about 1–5 minutes. Continue?",
    "重置后虚拟机还是没网，请检查本机网络/防火墙是否拦住了模拟器。": "The virtual machine is still offline after reset. Check whether your network or firewall is blocking the emulator.",
