    "现在只有一个 Android 14 通用镜像，x86 与 ARM 应用都能跑，首次遇到 ARM 应用时会自动下载，不需要手动切换。此开关仅用于旧配置兼容。": "There is now one universal Android 14 image for both x86 and ARM apps. It is downloaded automatically when an ARM app is first detected; no manual switching is needed. This option is kept for older configurations.",
    "安卓虚拟机内部的无线网，关掉可省一点 CPU。": "Controls Wi-Fi inside the Android virtual machine. Turning it off saves a little CPU.",
    "彻底断网（含移动数据），需要安静时打开。": "Completely disconnects the network, including mobile data.",
    "关掉后界面切换明显更快，功能不受影响。": "Disabling animations makes the interface feel faster without affecting functionality.",
    "紧凑（省性能）": "Compact (saves resources)",
