    "快捷方式带真实应用图标，双击直接进应用": "Shortcuts use the real app icon and open the app directly",
    "Windows 搜索能搜到应用名，任务栏也按应用分组": "Apps appear in Windows Search and are grouped by app on the taskbar",
    "桌面图标被误删或被安全软件拦掉时，点这里按当前设置全部补齐。": "If desktop shortcuts are deleted or blocked by security software, select here to recreate them using the current settings.",
    "修改后旧目录里已有的文件会自动搬到新目录；正在运行的文件互通不受影响。": "Existing files are moved automatically after changing the folder. File sharing continues to work while apps are running.",
    "双击 APK 直接安装到 ApkStart（仅写入当前用户，无需管理员）": "Double-click APK files to install them in ApkStart (current user only; no administrator rights required)",
    "这里占用空间最大（数 GB）。改到非系统盘可大幅减轻 C 盘压力；修改后需重启软件，已存在的数据不会自动搬移（请手动复制后删除旧目录）。": "This folder uses the most space (several GB). Moving it to another drive can reduce pressure on C:. Restart the app after changing it. Existing data is not moved automatically; copy it manually, then delete the old folder.",
    "真正吃盘的是这一块：数据分区（默认 6 GB，可在上面对大）+ 快速启动快照（约 2–3 GB）。": "Most disk space is used here: the data partition (6 GB by default; increase it above) plus the quick-start snapshot (about 2–3 GB).",
    "磁盘紧张时把它指到另一个盘（如 D:），重启软件后生效；旧目录里的": "If disk space is low, move this to another drive (such as D:) and restart the app. The existing ",
    "可整体搬过去再删。": " can be moved as a whole before deleting the old folder.",
    "卸载会取消 .apk 关联并移除程序；便携版请按提示手动删除目录。": "Uninstalling removes the app and unregisters the .apk association. For the portable edition, follow the instructions to delete its folder manually.",
    "尚未检查": "Not checked yet",
    "从 GitHub（RoutineMiku/apkstart）获取最新版本；轻量版会下载便携包并自动替换程序文件，": "Get the latest version from GitHub (RoutineMiku/apkstart). The portable edition downloads the package and replaces program files automatically;",
    "运行时、已装应用与快照都不受影响。": "the runtime, installed apps, and snapshots are not affected.",
